message: "If you use this dataset or pipeline, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "crates.io package abandonment: point-in-time dataset, gold set and forecasting pipeline"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-18
# doi: 10.5281/zenodo.XXXXXXX        # fill in once the Zenodo record is published
repository-code: https://github.com/RiyaMathew-11/abandon-forecast
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
authors:
